Before you stand some of the most enormous ruins you have ever seen, the work
is obviously that of divine hands. The walls of the building whose threshold at
which you now stand tower high above the tallest of the trees here. That is
to say, where the walls still stand. Mist from the darkened jungle enshrounds
this building, hiding its true size from you. From its appearance, it seems to
be a temple of the grandest stature, and with each passing second you feel 
drawn closer.
